# Two of these are load-bearing rather than housekeeping, and both fail
# quietly: `**/dist` stops a stale host build being copied over the fresh one
# the build stage just made, and `*.sqlite` stops a locally-seeded database
# being baked into the image — which would defeat the entire named-volume
# design while looking like it worked.

.git
.github

node_modules
**/node_modules

**/dist
**/build
**/coverage

*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
data

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

**/*.md
docs

.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
